/// Inserts `value` into `arr` at position `idx`, shifting the tail right by 1.
/// This matches the behavior of `numpy.insert` for a single element.
///
/// Note: This keeps the original implementation; we only add specs.
/// Because the implementation consumes `arr` (via `into_iter`) and works over
